- Work only from `/Users/Moatazi/hotels-vendors-new` for the web platform. Before any deployment, read that checkout's configured Git remote; never invent, substitute, or copy from another workspace or repository.
- Live VPS trace, verified 2026-10-10: public Nginx traffic goes to PM2 `hotels-vendors-role-images`, port `3057`, running `/var/www/hv-releases/hv-integration-356ef-20261009`. The earlier PM2 `hotels-vendors-production` process and `/var/www/hv-release-production` are not the current public route.
